==Battleground==
*1 [[Zuche]] spawns after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*3 [[Wild Doge]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
*1 [[Duche]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Casaurian Ahirujo]] spawns as the boss.
**10 [[Wild Doge]]s spawn, delay 16.67~23.33 seconds<sup>500f~700f</sup>.
**2 [[Duche]]s spawn, delay 46.67~53.33 seconds<sup>1,400f~1,600f</sup>.
**3 [[Zuche]]s spawn, delay 36.67~43.33 seconds<sup>1,100f~1,300f</sup>.
**1 [[Othom]] spawns.

==Strategy==
Like any Casaurian Ahirujo stage, [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]] gets the job done. The real issue are the Zuches, which you need to bring strong attackers like [[Express Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Bullet Train Cat]] and [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can Cat]] to properly handle them. Your main meatshield of choice should be either a high level [[Rocker Cat (Rare Cat)|Ramen Cat]] or [[Ancient Egg: N001 (Special Cat)|Haniwa Cat]] to tank the Wild Doges. Bring something to help in cleaning up Othom, like [[Swimmer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Fishman Cat]] or [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]].

